<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#151b2b"><title>CFPlanner</title><link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head>
<body><main id="app"><header><div class="brand"><span class="mark">CF</span><div><b>CFPlanner</b><small>Training planner</small></div></div><div id="userbar"></div></header>
<section id="auth" class="auth card"><h1>Ton entraînement, structuré.</h1><p>Planifie tes cycles, suis tes WOD et mesure ta régularité.</p><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" data-tab="login">Connexion</button><button class="tab" data-tab="register">Créer un compte</button></div><form id="authform"><label>E-mail<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Mot de passe<input name="password" type="password" minlength="12" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><button class="primary" id="authsubmit">Se connecter</button><p class="hint" id="authhint">Mot de passe de 12 caractères minimum.</p><div id="autherror" class="error"></div></form></section>
<section id="dashboard" hidden><div class="welcome"><div><p class="eyebrow">ESPACE PERSONNEL</p><h1>Mon entraînement</h1><p class="muted">Construis tes cycles. Ajuste tes objectifs. Garde le cap.</p></div><button id="newprogram" class="primary">＋ Nouveau programme</button></div>
<div class="weekbar card"><button id="prevweek" class="iconbtn">‹</button><div><small>SEMAINE DU</small><strong id="weeklabel"></strong></div><button id="nextweek" class="iconbtn">›</button><button id="today" class="ghost">Aujourd'hui</button></div>
<div id="weeksummary" class="stats"></div><div id="programnotice"></div><div id="entries" class="entries"></div>
<section class="card programs"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Mes programmes</h2></div><div id="programlist"></div></section></section>
<dialog id="programdialog" class="modal"><form id="programform" method="dialog"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Nouveau programme</h2><button type="button" class="iconbtn" id="closeprogram">×</button></div><label>Nom du programme<input name="name" placeholder="Ex. Cycle force & haltéro" required maxlength="100"></label><div class="two"><label>Première semaine<input name="start" type="date" required></label><label>Dernière semaine<input name="end" type="date" required></label></div><p class="hint">Les dates sont automatiquement ramenées au lundi de chaque semaine. Les périodes de programmes ne peuvent pas se chevaucher.</p><button class="primary">Créer le programme</button><div class="error" id="programerror"></div></form></dialog>
<dialog id="entrydialog" class="modal"><form id="entryform" method="dialog"><div class="sectionhead"><h2>Ajouter / modifier un WOD</h2><button type="button" class="iconbtn" id="closeentry">×</button></div><input type="hidden" name="program_id"><label>Catégorie<input name="category" placeholder="Muscu, Haltéro, Metcon, Zone 2..." required maxlength="60"></label><div class="two"><label>Prévu cette semaine<input name="target_count" type="number" min="0" max="99" value="1"></label><label>Réalisé<input name="done_count" type="number" min="0" max="999" value="0"></label></div><label>Prévision / contenu planifié<textarea name="planned_comment" rows="3"></textarea></label><label>Réalisé / notes<textarea name="actual_comment" rows="3"></textarea></label><button class="primary">Enregistrer</button><div class="error" id="entryerror"></div></form></dialog>
<div id="toast" role="status"></div></main><script src="/app.js"></script></body></html>
